## npulse
<p><b>Description:</b><br>
Number of pulses in the pulse sequence. <br>
This tag is required to define the number of pulses in the pulse sequence. <br>
Removed <br>
    \todo Hyeonsu </p>
    HahnEcho ? CPMG? Ramsey? when?

<p><b>Data Type:</b> Int </p>
